        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is within the combat range of a friendly **Clanrats** unit that has 5 or more models, and there are no other friendly **^^Weapon Team^^** units within that unit&apos;s combat range, this unit is not visible to enemy units more than 13&quot; away.</characteristic>
