                            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit uses a **^^Shoot^^** ability, if all of its attacks targeted the same enemy unit, after that ability has been resolved, roll a dice. If the result is equal to or less than the number of models in that enemy unit that were slain by attacks made by this unit&apos;s **Clawed Catapult** this phase, that enemy unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
